{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;NINDO: Guardian of the starlit shadow&quot;</strong> is a ninja rogue-like deck-building game set in a beautiful Japanese-inspired world. Face powerful enemies, make strategic choices, and grow stronger to craft a unique battle style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Stunning Anime-Style Visuals with a Japanese Touch</strong><br>Explore a captivating world that blends traditional Japanese aesthetics with vibrant anime-style artwork. Meet unique characters and foes that bring the story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Deck-Building + Tactical Combat System</strong><br>Strengthen your deck with new cards after every battle! Utilize Ninjutsu, Martial Arts, and Ultimate Techniques to execute strategic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Roguelike Elements for Endless Replayability</strong><br>Every dungeon run presents a new challenge. Even in defeat, you grow stronger and more skilled for your next thrilling attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Deep Storytelling through Flavor Text</strong><br>Uncover the past and fate of the ninja warriors of Starshadow through detailed card and item descriptions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dungeons and engage in battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to defeat powerful enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire new cards and items to enhance your deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own <strong>NINDO</strong> and master the way of the ninja!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Add to your Wishlist now and don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458600?t=1745